arStrings.szText:
Your {c_important}Catalyst{/c} now deals Fire and or Burning damage. It destroys enemy structures and has a {c_number}[{SF_11}*100|%|]{/c} chance to ignite the ground beneath enemies, dealing {c_random}{payload:DAMAGE}{/c} Burning damage over {c_number}{SF_8}{/c} seconds.

While equipped, your Fire Damage Bonus is equal to that of your highest Damage Type Bonus.{if:SF_6}

Deactivates monster {c_important}Chilling Wind{/c} effects for {c_number}{SF_4}{/c} seconds.{/if}
